4273
03:15:47,480 --> 03:15:48,680
Or maybe I do and it's not...

4274
03:15:48,680 --> 03:15:49,400
I don't know, actually.

4275
03:15:49,640 --> 03:15:50,040
What's that?

4276
03:15:51,600 --> 03:15:52,800
Mine ingredient Enderman!

4277
03:15:53,560 --> 03:15:56,640
This is the step towards getting to the dragon.

4278
03:15:59,100 --> 03:16:00,060
