It feels good.

4284
03:16:09,580 --> 03:16:09,780
Yeah!

4285
03:16:12,390 --> 03:16:12,990
Look at this.

4286
03:16:14,790 --> 03:16:16,190
Oh, yeah, dude.

4287
03:16:16,930 --> 03:16:17,730
I need to...

4288
03:16:17,730 --> 03:16:19,270
I need to make a...

4289
03:16:19,270 --> 03:16:21,010
An EDP.

4290
03:16:22,030 --> 03:16:24,190
In fact, we're gonna make the UEDP.

4291
03:16:25,770 --> 03:16:29,250
It has never been attempted before, but I think I may try it this one time.

4292
03:16:31,050 --> 03:16:31,830
It's risky.

4293
03:16:33,490 --> 03:16:35,990
It's very risky, but I think we can make it work in this...

4294
03:16:37,230 --> 03:16:37,950
Situation here.

4295
03:16:38,050 --> 03:16:38,350
I see him.

4296
03:16:38,410 --> 03:16:39,110
He's right over there.

4297
03:16:39,770 --> 03:16:41,470
That bastard is stealing dirt.

4298
03:16:46,160 --> 03:16:46,520
