4299
03:16:47,100 --> 03:16:47,460
Uh...

4300
03:16:47,460 --> 03:16:48,440
We don't have any trees.

4301
03:16:48,560 --> 03:16:49,060
That's a problem.

4302
03:16:49,620 --> 03:16:50,860
What do we do in that situation?

4303
03:16:52,320 --> 03:16:53,580
Can we make sticks out of this?

4304
03:16:54,580 --> 03:16:55,720
Can we make sticks out of these?

4305
03:17:02,980 --> 03:17:03,900
I actually don't know.

4306
03:17:06,620 --> 03:17:06,980
Uh...

4307
03:17:06,980 --> 03:17:07,480
Shit.

4308
03:17:08,240 --> 03:17:09,120
I don't know.

4309
03:17:12,580 --> 03:17:13,400
Wait, do you...

4310
03:17:13,400 --> 03:17:14,280
Do you have a...

4311
03:17:14,280 --> 03:17:14,700
Sword?

4312
03:17:14,820 --> 03:17:15,480
No, you have a...

4313
03:17:15,480 --> 03:17:15,780
Bow.

4314
03:17:22,490 --> 03:17:23,090
Advancement?

4315
03:17:23,590 --> 03:17:24,870
