4316
03:17:28,470 --> 03:17:31,990
Kill a skeleton to unlock this spooky scary skeleton special event.

4317
03:17:32,830 --> 03:17:33,090
Aha!

4318
03:17:34,970 --> 03:17:36,850
Love spooky scary skeletons!

4319
03:17:38,230 --> 03:17:38,830
Okay.

4320
03:17:39,790 --> 03:17:41,190
