4336
03:18:26,250 --> 03:18:28,330
Carrot on a stick thing.

4337
03:18:29,090 --> 03:18:29,910
Oh shit.

4338
03:18:31,810 --> 03:18:32,910
Oh, oh, oh.

4339
03:18:32,930 --> 03:18:33,190
Oh, oh, oh!

4340
03:18:33,290 --> 03:18:33,470
Oh oh, oh, oh!

4341
03:18:34,870 --> 03:18:35,490
Get out of there!

4342
03:18:35,610 --> 03:18:35,970
Get out of there!

4343
03:18:36,730 --> 03:18:38,090
We are not equipped to deal with this.

4344
03:18:42,830 --> 03:18:43,230
Fuck.

4345
03:18:45,890 --> 03:18:46,650
I'm level 7.

4346
03:18:46,890 --> 03:18:47,810
Get me faster swim speed.

4347
03:18:48,550 --> 03:18:49,090
Here we go!

4348
03:18:49,890 --> 03:18:50,990
I know Karate~!

4349
03:18:50,990 --> 03:18:52,150
It's just like Matrix!

4350
03:18:53,390 --> 03:18:53,790
Morpheus.

4351
03:18:54,750 --> 03:18:57,630
I'm gonna need to be able to be an Olympian swimmer.

4352
03:18:58,090 --> 03:18:58,810
Hold on a moment.

4353
