4356
03:19:09,530 --> 03:19:11,870
Does it look like someone took a bite out of that mountain over there?

4357
03:19:13,190 --> 03:19:16,690
Either that or it looks like Patrick's head from Spongebob.

4358
03:19:16,870 --> 03:19:17,570
A little bit.

4359
