I need wheat.

4369
03:19:48,500 --> 03:19:49,340
Yes, they have it!

4370
03:19:49,760 --> 03:19:50,220
Wonderful.

4371
03:19:51,360 --> 03:19:52,480
Endless supply of bread incoming.

4372
