Enderman hate cats, right?

4384
03:20:18,150 --> 03:20:18,930
A book.

4385
03:20:20,970 --> 03:20:22,010
A BUNDLE!

4386
03:20:25,380 --> 03:20:25,900
Okay.

4387
03:20:26,620 --> 03:20:27,340
That's huge.

4388
03:20:30,920 --> 03:20:31,800
Sup, cows?

4389
03:20:31,960 --> 03:20:32,440
You're free!

4390
03:20:35,780 --> 03:20:36,220
Uh...

4391
03:20:36,220 --> 03:20:37,520
Yeah, you look weird.

4392
03:20:37,900 --> 03:20:40,100
They did something to the cows in the last update.

4393
03:20:40,740 --> 03:20:42,000
They look all weird now.

4394
03:20:44,300 --> 03:20:44,740
Crap.

4395
03:20:48,140 --> 03:20:51,160
Why do they have these cacti sti- Ugh, everywhere.

4396
03:20:51,860 --> 03:20:52,960
It's a health hazard.

4397
03:20:54,960 --> 03:20:55,400
Shit.

4398
03:20:56,380 --> 03:20:58,560
Okay, I'm gonna need to, uh, acquisition this.

4399
03:20:58,740 --> 03:21:00,000
That's not a real way to say that.

4400
03:21:01,880 --> 03:21:02,920
It stinks in here.

4401
03:21:03,580 --> 03:21:04,480
Smells like meat.

4402
03:21:05,340 --> 03:21:05,980
Rotten meat.

4403
03:21:07,580 --> 03:21:10,520
Kids, why would you bring that rotten meat in here of all places?

4404
03:21:10,920 --> 03:21:11,980
Ha ha ha ha ha ha!

4405
03:21:13,800 --> 03:21:15,640
Ah, think about your dad.

4406
03:21:18,240 --> 03:21:19,100
That's a blast.

4407
03:21:20,300 --> 03:21:20,740
Um...

4408
03:21:20,740 --> 03:21:21,540
Well, shit.

4409
03:21:21,540 --> 03:21:22,660
I don't really have much here.

4410
03:21:24,260 --> 03:21:24,780
Bread.

4411
03:21:25,500 --> 03:21:26,140
Make it.

4412
03:21:26,320 --> 03:21:27,040
37 bread.

4413
03:21:27,200 --> 03:21:28,000
I'm so ready for combat.

4414
03:21:28,120 --> 03:21:29,360
Now I just need an actual sword.

4415
03:21:29,920 --> 03:21:31,900
The problem is, there's no wood!

4416
03:21:33,060 --> 03:21:35,020
