4417
03:21:37,220 --> 03:21:38,700
Do you have wood in here, somehow?

4418
03:21:39,520 --> 03:21:40,040
Anywhere?

4419
03:21:42,360 --> 03:21:42,880
Wood?

4420
03:21:44,180 --> 03:21:44,940
It's all desert!

4421
03:21:48,420 --> 03:21:49,540
I can't even make a boat.

4422
03:21:50,240 --> 03:21:50,940
This is bad.

4423
03:21:53,340 --> 03:21:53,700
Hmm...

4424
03:21:53,700 --> 03:21:54,300
Shit.

4425
03:21:55,500 --> 03:21:56,760
Also, I came from over there.

4426
03:21:56,820 --> 03:21:57,860
I need to go back that way, because...

4427
03:21:58,680 --> 03:21:59,880
The Enderman is over there.

4428
