4431
03:22:10,120 --> 03:22:11,740
Am I going as fast as a boat right now?

4432
03:22:13,300 --> 03:22:14,340
This is very fast.

4433
03:22:20,160 --> 03:22:21,060
Oh, sick shot!

4434
03:22:21,160 --> 03:22:21,680
I actually hit him.

4435
03:22:30,620 --> 03:22:31,640
He's over here somewhere.

4436
03:22:32,320 --> 03:22:34,020
Maybe I should just engage him with a bone.

4437
03:22:34,160 --> 03:22:36,800
I mean, if I can make an EDP, it doesn't even matter.

4438
03:22:37,500 --> 03:22:39,700
I could punch him down with my pinky.

4439
03:22:39,960 --> 03:22:40,700
And it's fine.

4440
03:22:44,940 --> 03:22:47,380
Man, this bow sucks when you're used to having a good bow.

4441
03:22:52,060 --> 03:22:54,080
You know what kind of unlock I want?

4442
03:22:54,180 --> 03:22:57,960
I want the unlock that gives me the ability to sprint without losing food.

4443
03:22:57,960 --> 03:22:59,740
Hey, now we're talking.

4444
03:23:00,860 --> 03:23:01,820
The hell?

4445
03:23:02,140 --> 03:23:02,840
Oh, shit.

4446
03:23:03,400 --> 03:23:04,780
Oh, this is actually kind of risky.

4447
03:23:09,000 --> 03:23:10,020
Yeah, kill him!

4448
03:23:12,500 --> 03:23:13,280
Good job!

4449
03:23:18,460 --> 03:23:19,560
Oh, I'm so good.

4450
03:23:20,460 --> 03:23:21,000
Wonderful.

4451
03:23:26,860 --> 03:23:27,280
Yeah!

4452
03:23:29,200 --> 03:23:29,740
Dankeschön!

4453
03:23:30,760 --> 03:23:31,000
You.

4454
03:23:36,160 --> 03:23:37,060
Ah, he's over there!

4455
03:23:37,100 --> 03:23:37,300
Look!

4456
03:23:37,300 --> 03:23:38,240
He's highlighted!

4457
03:23:40,500 --> 03:23:42,280
Let's bring out the materials.

4458
03:23:42,460 --> 03:23:45,140
I can't even make an EDP because all of this here is sand!

4459
03:23:46,560 --> 03:23:48,000
Ah, but we got sandstone.

4460
03:23:48,240 --> 03:23:48,860
That can be used.

4461
