I can't!

4467
03:24:09,370 --> 03:24:10,170
Oh my god!

4468
03:24:12,390 --> 03:24:12,810
Stone!

4469
03:24:14,010 --> 03:24:15,690
Can I break that with my bare hands?

4470
03:24:15,750 --> 03:24:17,070
I don't think so.

4471
03:24:19,290 --> 03:24:22,490
Otherwise, I would just do that every time instead of making wood first, right?

4472
03:24:24,550 --> 03:24:25,270
There's no way.

4473
03:24:25,770 --> 03:24:26,110
Shit.

4474
03:24:31,120 --> 03:24:32,720
Maybe look for a natural EDP.

4475
03:24:33,360 --> 03:24:34,960
An N-U-E-D-P.

4476
03:24:35,160 --> 03:24:35,820
Oh, up there maybe.

4477
03:24:36,100 --> 03:24:36,300
Oh!

4478
03:24:36,480 --> 03:24:36,900
Up here!

4479
03:24:38,140 --> 03:24:39,620
But then I have to lure him over here.

4480
03:24:39,720 --> 03:24:40,760
That's not going to work very well.

4481
03:24:40,920 --> 03:24:42,280
I want to kill him right where he is.

4482
03:24:43,480 --> 03:24:43,980
Maybe this?

4483
03:24:47,950 --> 03:24:49,210
Oh, I think that will work!

4484
03:24:50,890 --> 03:24:51,610
Cactus method!

4485
03:24:57,220 --> 03:24:59,160
Oh, if you break the bottom, everything falls apart.

4486
03:25:06,810 --> 03:25:08,050
Get away from me!

4487
03:25:13,410 --> 03:25:14,070
There we go.

4488
