I wonder if he's going to hurt himself by walking into these.

4489
03:25:23,410 --> 03:25:23,970
Imagine that?

4490
03:25:25,050 --> 03:25:26,050
Would that be the old...

4491
03:25:26,050 --> 03:25:28,050
Am I just discovering something completely new?

4492
03:25:28,170 --> 03:25:28,570
New tech?

4493
03:25:31,640 --> 03:25:32,600
Okay, he's right here.

4494
03:25:33,640 --> 03:25:34,300
Let's make it here.

4495
03:25:36,940 --> 03:25:37,600
Wait, wait, wait.

4496
03:25:40,120 --> 03:25:43,400
Okay, as long as I don't look at him, he's not going to be angry, right?

4497
03:25:43,500 --> 03:25:44,380
Yeah, okay, okay, okay.

4498
03:25:45,180 --> 03:25:46,360
I'm going to be doing it here.

4499
03:25:47,800 --> 03:25:49,020
Give me sand.

4500
03:25:52,900 --> 03:25:53,540
Oh!

4501
03:25:53,980 --> 03:25:55,100
Okay, we're good.

4502
03:25:55,580 --> 03:25:56,240
