04:17:27,060 --> 04:17:27,540
Okay.

5626
04:17:28,180 --> 04:17:28,900
We're safe.

5627
04:17:29,780 --> 04:17:30,200
Kinda.

5628
04:17:30,540 --> 04:17:30,860
