5629
04:17:30,880 --> 04:17:31,320
We're not safe.

5630
04:17:32,360 --> 04:17:34,700
Oh, this is hell.

5631
04:17:43,020 --> 04:17:44,220
Eternal Lightning.

5632
04:17:44,680 --> 04:17:45,420
Not good.

5633
04:17:46,140 --> 04:17:46,880
And those Guardians.

5634
04:17:47,400 --> 04:17:48,460
Not good.

5635
04:17:49,340 --> 04:17:50,100
Not good.

5636
04:17:50,460 --> 04:17:51,360
Forest Biomes.

5637
04:17:52,420 --> 04:17:52,820
And.

5638
04:17:53,340 --> 04:17:53,740
Okay.

5639
