5646
04:18:06,040 --> 04:18:06,980
I love sweat.

5647
04:18:08,300 --> 04:18:10,180
Uh, I like, I like Fish Out of Water.

5648
04:18:10,340 --> 04:18:11,120
I'm happy with that.

5649
04:18:11,260 --> 04:18:11,800
I am.

5650
04:18:11,940 --> 04:18:12,960
It's just Eternal Lightning.

5651
04:18:13,220 --> 04:18:13,780
Not good.

5652
04:18:14,920 --> 04:18:15,600
Eternal Night.

5653
04:18:15,760 --> 04:18:16,320
It's like, whatever.

5654
04:18:16,320 --> 04:18:17,220
I don't care about that.

5655
04:18:17,380 --> 04:18:18,080
At all.

5656
04:18:20,200 --> 04:18:20,640
Insomniacs.

5657
04:18:20,940 --> 04:18:21,160
Uh.

5658
04:18:22,680 --> 04:18:23,360
What's this?

5659
04:18:24,300 --> 04:18:25,180
Wither Skeletons.

5660
04:18:25,380 --> 04:18:26,700
Wither, Blister, Burn, and Peel.

5661
04:18:26,820 --> 04:18:27,060
Ooh.

5662
04:18:28,460 --> 04:18:28,900
Yeah.

5663
04:18:29,880 --> 04:18:30,880
Don't know about that.

5664
04:18:34,080 --> 04:18:36,520
Why is this one not giving me extra XP?

5665
