No rest, no respite.

5667
04:18:40,640 --> 04:18:41,380
I don't know what that means.

5668
04:18:44,740 --> 04:18:45,180
Zombies.

5669
04:18:46,300 --> 04:18:46,740
Insomniacs.

5670
04:18:47,800 --> 04:18:49,120
Okay, I think I know what that means.

5671
04:18:49,620 --> 04:18:52,920
Probably means that enemies are also spawning during the day.

5672
04:18:54,640 --> 04:18:56,860
But that doesn't matter because it's night all the time anyway.

5673
04:18:57,140 --> 04:18:57,680
Who cares?

5674
04:19:02,130 --> 04:19:02,790
It's fine.

5675
04:19:03,750 --> 04:19:04,810
Am I a fish out of water?

5676
04:19:04,890 --> 04:19:05,130
I am.

5677
04:19:07,130 --> 04:19:08,010
Okay, here we go.

5678
04:19:08,310 --> 04:19:08,690
This one.

5679
04:19:08,850 --> 04:19:09,350
That one.

5680
04:19:10,050 --> 04:19:10,170
Uh.

5681
04:19:10,910 --> 04:19:11,170
Chicken?

5682
04:19:12,210 --> 04:19:12,870
No chicken.

5683
04:19:14,750 --> 04:19:15,750
Alright, who wants to die?

5684
04:19:16,030 --> 04:19:18,970
So what exactly is the plan now since I'm a fish?

5685
04:19:20,050 --> 04:19:21,070
What is the plan?

5686
04:19:23,350 --> 04:19:25,510
Am I going to shoot arrows that are fiery too?

5687
04:19:25,690 --> 04:19:25,810
No.

5688
04:19:26,190 --> 04:19:26,550
Oh no.

5689
04:19:26,710 --> 04:19:28,050
Arrows are bad on the water.

5690
04:19:29,470 --> 04:19:30,670
Why didn't I think about that?

5691
04:19:31,570 --> 04:19:32,690
I guess I can go mine.

5692
04:19:33,350 --> 04:19:34,950
Is it going to make me mine faster now?

5693
04:19:50,760 --> 04:19:51,800
Oh shit.

5694
04:19:58,410 --> 04:20:00,930
I'm hearing odd sounds down here.

5695
04:20:04,530 --> 04:20:05,710
I'm a campfire.

5696
04:20:05,830 --> 04:20:07,050
Why am I not lighting things up?

5697
04:20:20,290 --> 04:20:21,190
I hear bats.

5698
04:20:24,680 --> 04:20:25,440
Okay, you know what?

5699
04:20:25,500 --> 04:20:28,880
I don't think I like this campfire man mode.

5700
04:20:29,940 --> 04:20:31,560
Campfire man mode is not good.

5701
04:20:32,100 --> 04:20:32,660
Can I undo?

5702
04:20:34,380 --> 04:20:35,220
Let me undo.

5703
04:20:36,160 --> 04:20:38,280
I guess I need to try and punch someone and see what happens.

5704
04:20:38,420 --> 04:20:40,000
Maybe they're going to take a million damage.

5705
04:20:40,400 --> 04:20:41,140
That would be fun.

5706
04:20:42,120 --> 04:20:42,840
One punch man.

5707
04:20:43,440 --> 04:20:44,560
Nah, this world sucks.

5708
04:20:45,880 --> 04:20:46,980
There's nothing to do down here.

5709
04:20:47,040 --> 04:20:48,680
I feel like fish out of water is...

5710
04:20:50,200 --> 04:20:51,040
Not that great.

5711
04:20:51,720 --> 04:20:54,380
But let's see if there's leaves up on the surface.

5712
04:20:56,300 --> 04:20:57,620
The fucking leaves.

5713
04:20:58,480 --> 04:21:00,300
Nah, it's definitely getting a little silly now.

5714
04:21:01,080 --> 04:21:02,060
I realize that.

5715
04:21:02,780 --> 04:21:04,240
I'm playing a little silly.

5716
04:21:04,400 --> 04:21:04,760
Oh, you there.

5717
04:21:06,360 --> 04:21:06,760
Nice.

5718
04:21:08,600 --> 04:21:09,760
I'll be taking that.

5719
04:21:13,140 --> 04:21:14,020
That's where I started.

5720
04:21:17,980 --> 04:21:20,180
Bro, I wonder if I can go...

5721
04:21:20,180 --> 04:21:22,860
Walk around with a bucket of water and just pour it on my head.

5722
04:21:23,980 --> 04:21:25,000
Whenever I need to breathe.

5723
04:21:32,130 --> 04:21:33,850
You know what would be really fun?

5724
04:21:34,390 --> 04:21:37,550
To really try and get one of these mines going for a long time.

5725
04:21:37,650 --> 04:21:38,370
And I'm thinking...

5726
04:21:38,370 --> 04:21:40,450
You go for fish out of water, right?

5727
04:21:41,490 --> 04:21:44,070
You also get the upgrade with the enchanting table.

5728
04:21:44,450 --> 04:21:46,250
You somehow try to get...

5729
04:21:48,030 --> 04:21:50,270
The underwater breathing enchant on the helmet.

5730
04:21:50,770 --> 04:21:53,090
And I guess it's gonna work on land then.

5731
04:21:53,430 --> 04:21:53,830
Right?

5732
04:21:53,890 --> 04:21:55,230
So you can stay longer on land.

5733
04:21:55,350 --> 04:21:56,510
You're gonna get so much experience.

5734
04:21:56,770 --> 04:21:58,090
You're gonna try and collect as much as you can.

5735
04:21:58,430 --> 04:22:00,130
And try to get home with like a thousand.

5736
04:22:01,150 --> 04:22:01,750
Imagine that.

5737
04:22:01,890 --> 04:22:02,550
Let's go punch someone.

5738
04:22:05,660 --> 04:22:06,700
I set them on fire.

5739
04:22:08,660 --> 04:22:09,060
Oh.

5740
04:22:09,240 --> 04:22:09,500
Oh!

5741
04:22:09,600 --> 04:22:10,080
Cooked meat!

5742
04:22:10,240 --> 04:22:10,860
Ah, I see!

5743
04:22:11,560 --> 04:22:12,360
That's huge!

5744
04:22:13,140 --> 04:22:13,960
Actually amazing.

5745
04:22:15,220 --> 04:22:16,680
Doesn't work like that though, does it?

5746
04:22:17,160 --> 04:22:17,940
Oh, I need to...

5747
04:22:17,940 --> 04:22:18,620
I need to breathe!

5748
04:22:24,510 --> 04:22:25,570
Terror from the deep.

5749
04:22:26,030 --> 04:22:26,730
That's me.

5750
04:22:27,490 --> 04:22:28,490
And we got leaves.

5751
04:22:29,530 --> 04:22:31,910
I have so many XP modifiers on right now.

5752
04:22:34,430 --> 04:22:35,090
Get in.

5753
04:22:36,190 --> 04:22:37,350
This is so silly.

5754
04:22:38,910 --> 04:22:39,950
What am I doing?

5755
04:22:44,480 --> 04:22:45,500
I'm lacking food.

5756
04:22:45,640 --> 04:22:46,560
That's what's happening right now.

5757
04:22:48,080 --> 04:22:49,720
My brain is not functioning correctly.

5758
04:22:49,720 --> 04:22:50,760
Because I need that nutrition.

5759
04:22:51,140 --> 04:22:51,600
That energy.

5760
04:22:52,340 --> 04:22:53,200
Get in the water.

5761
04:22:57,780 --> 04:22:58,860
Definitely want to punch them.

5762
04:23:02,950 --> 04:23:04,050
Give me that meat.

5763
04:23:04,350 --> 04:23:05,090
The cooked meat.

5764
04:23:08,480 --> 04:23:09,960
Fish out of water is a no-go.

5765
04:23:10,080 --> 04:23:10,300
Honestly.

5766
04:23:11,480 --> 04:23:13,000
It's fun in theory, but...

5767
04:23:13,000 --> 04:23:14,200
It's not really that good.

5768
04:23:15,440 --> 04:23:16,980
Let's see if we can't find an exit.

5769
04:23:20,820 --> 04:23:22,580
I need to really think about the next world.

5770
04:23:22,720 --> 04:23:23,960
The next world, I'm gonna play serious.

5771
04:23:24,160 --> 04:23:25,240
This one was a bit of a...

5772
04:23:25,240 --> 04:23:26,180
Rash decision.

5773
04:23:27,040 --> 04:23:29,760
I think I just really wanted the fish out of water to work somehow.

5774
04:23:31,580 --> 04:23:33,180
It's not doing me any favors right now.

5775
04:23:35,060 --> 04:23:35,460
Huh?

5776
04:23:37,460 --> 04:23:38,240
What was that?

5777
04:23:41,660 --> 04:23:42,500
What just happened?

5778
04:23:45,220 --> 04:23:45,620
What?

5779
04:23:46,580 --> 04:23:48,480
Oh, I'm cooking the meat in the head.

5780
04:23:48,660 --> 04:23:48,780
Look.

5781
04:23:50,820 --> 04:23:51,960
Oh, that's amazing.

5782
04:23:53,800 --> 04:23:54,820
Go into my mouth.

5783
04:23:57,040 --> 04:23:57,520
Yes.

5784
04:23:58,520 --> 04:23:59,540
That's actually cool.

5785
04:24:00,420 --> 04:24:01,200
Really useful.

5786
04:24:04,790 --> 04:24:05,770
Show me a light.

5787
04:24:05,890 --> 04:24:06,490
Okay, so hold on.

5788
04:24:06,590 --> 04:24:07,170
Do we have an...

5789
04:24:07,170 --> 04:24:08,870
We have a surface exit.

5790
04:24:09,690 --> 04:24:10,170
Okay.

5791
04:24:12,370 --> 04:24:14,050
So it needs to be somewhere up here.

5792
04:24:16,150 --> 04:24:16,750
Whoa!

5793
04:24:17,790 --> 04:24:18,590
What the?

5794
04:24:20,230 --> 04:24:21,490
What just happened there?

5795
04:24:24,840 --> 04:24:25,840
You saw that?

5796
04:24:27,160 --> 04:24:28,380
Can I make it happen again?

5797
04:24:30,100 --> 04:24:31,440
That was weird.

5798
04:24:36,810 --> 04:24:37,910
Oh, here we go again.

5799
04:24:40,510 --> 04:24:41,430
What's happening?

5800
04:24:44,030 --> 04:24:45,250
Something is approaching.

5801
04:24:52,670 --> 04:24:54,130
I don't know what it is.

5802
04:24:54,610 --> 04:24:55,290
Scares me.

5803
04:25:03,320 --> 04:25:03,880
Come on.

5804
04:25:04,060 --> 04:25:05,240
Show me something good.

5805
04:25:06,940 --> 04:25:09,700
I feel like such a predator when I'm in the water like this.

5806
04:25:09,900 --> 04:25:11,120
Top of the food chain, you know?

5807
04:25:11,980 --> 04:25:12,780
Nobody's safe from me.

5808
04:25:13,520 --> 04:25:16,220
Any animal out there is below me and I'm gonna find it.

5809
04:25:16,280 --> 04:25:17,780
I'm gonna appear out of the water like this.

5810
04:25:19,180 --> 04:25:22,840
In the middle of the night and I'm gonna take the children and the...

5811
04:25:22,840 --> 04:25:29,180
and the women and the men and the husbands and everyone and I'm gonna take them down to the den and I'm gonna slaughter them all.

5812
04:25:29,800 --> 04:25:30,220
You know?

5813
04:25:30,280 --> 04:25:41,280
And there's gonna be tails around me among the villages that this creature from the depths comes out during the night, grabs unsuspecting people and takes them with him underneath the water.

5814
04:25:42,220 --> 04:25:43,600
That's fucking dark, man.

5815
04:25:44,580 --> 04:25:45,660
Oh, shit.

5816
04:25:49,330 --> 04:25:50,170
Like, look at this.

5817
04:25:50,250 --> 04:25:54,790
I'm a fucking flaming hand man coming out of the water in the middle of the night.

5818
04:25:55,730 --> 04:25:57,510
Oh, it's eternal night as well.

5819
04:25:57,610 --> 04:25:58,910
What a nightmare this world is.

5820
04:26:00,410 --> 04:26:01,950
Man, where are the exit portals?

5821
04:26:08,750 --> 04:26:09,150
Really?

5822
04:26:09,230 --> 04:26:12,930
You see me coming out of the water like a fish with flame in my hand and you still want a piece of me?

5823
04:26:13,130 --> 04:26:13,350
Hmm.

5824
04:26:14,590 --> 04:26:15,790
I salute your bravery.

5825
04:26:16,930 --> 04:26:18,070
Something I've noticed just now.

5826
04:26:18,750 --> 04:26:20,370
I'm not losing any food.

5827
04:26:22,070 --> 04:26:23,190
I wonder why that is.

5828
04:26:23,970 --> 04:26:27,150
Is it just the steak being that good or is something else going on here?

5829
04:26:31,260 --> 04:26:32,360
Ah, take me up.

5830
04:26:33,560 --> 04:26:34,640
It doesn't want to take me up.

5831
04:26:39,000 --> 04:26:39,600
There we go.

5832
04:26:41,300 --> 04:26:42,800
We gotta go on land, I guess.

5833
04:26:43,280 --> 04:26:44,140
To see this.

5834
04:26:51,910 --> 04:26:53,750
It's actually kind of a problem, isn't it?

5835
04:26:55,490 --> 04:26:56,310
This ain't good.

5836
04:27:00,410 --> 04:27:01,050
Back in the water!

5837
04:27:04,070 --> 04:27:04,430
Jesus!

5838
04:27:06,810 --> 04:27:08,550
Ah, maybe that's the fish out of water thing.

5839
04:27:09,290 --> 04:27:11,050
Because I take damage all the time, you know?

5840
04:27:11,550 --> 04:27:12,910
I can, uh...

5841
04:27:12,910 --> 04:27:16,970
Ah, maybe being a fish it doesn't cause stamina or food when I actually sprint underwater.

5842
04:27:17,830 --> 04:27:18,970
That's probably what's happening.

5843
04:27:19,730 --> 04:27:23,050
But if I were to run on land that would still drain my stamina.

5844
04:27:25,350 --> 04:27:27,250
I'm glad there's actually so much water here though.

5845
04:27:27,370 --> 04:27:28,650
Otherwise I would be fried.

5846
04:27:30,970 --> 04:27:31,750
Do I see water?

5847
04:27:31,790 --> 04:27:31,990
I do.

5848
04:27:32,330 --> 04:27:33,130
Go, go, go, go, go, go, go!

5849
04:27:34,250 --> 04:27:35,670
Hurry, hurry, hurry, hurry, hurry.

5850
04:27:36,250 --> 04:27:37,710
That also means I regen in water.

5851
04:27:40,230 --> 04:27:40,830
Get it!

5852
04:27:41,350 --> 04:27:42,390
Oi, oi, oi, oi, oi, oi.

5853
04:27:43,770 --> 04:27:44,730
I gotta eat that steak.

5854
04:27:45,550 --> 04:27:47,650
See, I lost stamina there when I was running on land.

5855
04:27:48,350 --> 04:27:49,330
Bro, there are no portals.

5856
04:27:51,670 --> 04:27:52,950
It's dry out there.

5857
04:27:59,050 --> 04:28:02,510
Are they like a certain distance inland or something?

5858
04:28:03,290 --> 04:28:03,690
Only?

5859
04:28:03,870 --> 04:28:06,130
Otherwise, I don't see how I couldn't have found one yet.

5860
04:28:15,790 --> 04:28:20,310
I guess I can also use enderpearls to get across large distances outside the water.

5861
04:28:20,650 --> 04:28:21,730
So I go like this, look.

5862
04:28:24,450 --> 04:28:24,770
Plop!

5863
04:28:24,970 --> 04:28:25,550
Down into the water.

5864
04:28:30,460 --> 04:28:30,780
Yeah!

5865
04:28:33,640 --> 04:28:35,860
The ultimate fish out of water strategies.

5866
04:28:38,680 --> 04:28:39,240
That's dope.

5867
04:28:41,080 --> 04:28:41,680
I see one!

5868
04:28:41,760 --> 04:28:42,120
I see one!

5869
04:28:42,180 --> 04:28:42,680
I see a portal!

5870
04:28:42,880 --> 04:28:43,940
We can make our way out of here!

5871
04:28:44,560 --> 04:28:44,880
Yes!

5872
04:28:45,380 --> 04:28:46,820
Let's grab some leaves on the way out.

5873
04:28:47,500 --> 04:28:48,620
Because we don't have enough!

5874
04:28:50,060 --> 04:28:51,480
That amplifier's going to be nuts!

5875
04:28:54,080 --> 04:28:55,000
You know it is.

5876
04:29:01,200 --> 04:29:01,520
Yep.

5877
04:29:01,980 --> 04:29:02,580
In, in, in, in, in.

5878
04:29:03,500 --> 04:29:04,240
There we are.

5879
04:29:06,320 --> 04:29:07,680
We don't have that much, but it's okay.

5880
04:29:07,780 --> 04:29:08,900
I don't want to collect too much either.

5881
04:29:09,560 --> 04:29:11,720
Because it's going to be annoying to get into the water all the time.

5882
04:29:15,030 --> 04:29:17,610
We're just going to go towards the light and collect what we can on the way.

5883
04:29:19,030 --> 04:29:19,650
That's the plan.

5884
04:29:20,650 --> 04:29:22,330
Oh, yay, yay, yay, yay, yay, yay, yay, yay, yay.

5885
04:29:23,570 --> 04:29:24,090
Calm down.

5886
04:29:25,310 --> 04:29:26,650
That was a very close one, actually.

5887
04:29:29,800 --> 04:29:30,360
Ah, you know what?

5888
04:29:30,360 --> 04:29:30,980
I don't want to deal with you.

5889
04:29:32,020 --> 04:29:32,940
Have a good one, man.

5890
04:29:35,460 --> 04:29:35,740
Whatever.

5891
04:29:43,150 --> 04:29:43,810
Go up here.

5892
04:29:44,330 --> 04:29:45,330
Oh, look at all these flowers.

5893
04:29:45,370 --> 04:29:45,810
What the hell?

5894
04:29:48,110 --> 04:29:49,210
Are they worth something?

5895
04:29:50,170 --> 04:29:50,550
Kinda.

5896
04:29:55,720 --> 04:29:56,400
Take that.

